{
  "title": "4+1D internal abelian products: zero intrinsic response",
  "scope": "Each row is one exact internal electronic symmetry; crystalline spin labels do not apply. E8, CI, charge and the common phase are computed with complete products and gauges. Rows retain the specified product presentation. Coprime cyclic products can be isomorphic to cyclic inputs in the separate table and serve as independent calculation controls. The intrinsic response pair (n0I,n0J) is fixed to zero. Reference answers are applied after calculation. Physical derivations and their exact scope are recorded in the cited sources and accepted evidence.",
